Bundled third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

deploy/bootstrap/ vendors upstream installation manifests that are applied
verbatim by the first-run bootstrap. They are redistributed under their own
licenses, not under the AGPL:

  * cert-manager.yaml  — cert-manager, Apache License 2.0
                         https://github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager
  * operator.yaml      — OpenSearch Kubernetes Operator, Apache License 2.0
                         https://github.com/opensearch-project/opensearch-k8s-operator
  * longhorn.yaml      — Longhorn, Apache License 2.0
                         https://github.com/longhorn/longhorn

Rust and npm dependencies are not vendored; their licenses are enforced by the
`supply-chain` CI job (see deny.toml) and resolved from Cargo.lock and
frontend/package-lock.json.
